        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The tool that checks whether your connection to the service is still alive now goes to sleep when no part of the app is waiting for its updates. Before this fix, certain sessions that stopped listening early would leave the checker running in the background forever, wasting energy and cluttering your network activity. You will not see any new buttons or settings, but the app will stop making pointless background pings the moment it finishes streaming, making the tool more efficient.",
