        "title": "Freebuff CLI 0.2.17 adds pclick shadow telemetry",
        "summary": "This release bumps the Freebuff CLI to 0.2.17 and extends the shared Axiom telemetry schema in `common/src/util/axiom-only-log.ts` with three new fields for the on-host pclick model shadow scoring. The new fields track the feature store input source, the offline batch score of the served campaign, and the log ratio between the shadow and batch scores. The release also carries four other changes from the 0.2.16 to 0.2.17 window, including a billboard frequency cap refactor and a connection monitor singleton extraction.",
