        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Freebuff 0.2.17 adds telemetry for ad click prediction and refines ad display limits. It also widens access to the DeepSeek fast model for limited-access users on paid plans. Specific changes include: - The DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Fast model is now available to limited-access users if they have a paid plan, whereas it was previously restricted to full-access accounts. - The frequency limits for side-ad billboards have been tightened; the sidebar now shows each campaign at most three times a day, with no more than once an hour, and the main panel shows each ad at most once a day. - A new shadow scoring system for ads tracks how well the click prediction model performs without affecting which ads you see. - The connection monitor was restructured to stop unnecessary background network checks when no one is actively using the terminal, reducing wasted server traffic. These updates adjust how ads appear and expand model availability for paid subscribers in certain regions.",
        "ctx": "b08aa065a3e9",
